</p></fn></fn-group></sec><sec id="ref-list1" sec-type="ref-list" disp-level="1"><title>References</title><sec id="ref-list1_sec2" disp-level="2"><ref-list><ref id="cit1"><mixed-citation><named-content content-type="citation-string">Tang C. W., VanSlyke S. A. Appl. Phys. Lett. 1987;51:913.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="journal=Appl. Phys. Lett.&amp;volume=51&amp;publication_year=1987&amp;pages=913&amp;"/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="cit2"><mixed-citation><named-content content-type="citation-string">Baldo M. A., Lamansky S., Burrows P. E., Thompson M. E., Forrest S. R. Appl. Phys. Lett. 1999;75:4.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="journal=Appl. Phys. Lett.&amp;volume=75&amp;publication_year=1999&amp;pages=4&amp;"/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="cit3"><mixed-citation><named-content content-type="citation-string">Adachi C., Baldo M. A., Thompson M. E., Forrest S. R. J. Appl. Phys. 2001;90:5048.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="journal=J. Appl. Phys.&amp;volume=90&amp;publication_year=2001&amp;pages=5048&amp;"/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="cit4"><mixed-citation><named-content content-type="citation-string">Reineke S., Lindner F., Schwartz G., Seidler N., Walzer K., Lüssem B., Leo K. Nature. 2009;459:234. doi: 10.1038/nature08003.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1038/nature08003"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="pmid" xlink:href="19444212"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="journal=Nature&amp;volume=459&amp;publication_year=2009&amp;pages=234&amp;pmid=19444212&amp;doi=10.1038/nature08003&amp;"/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="cit5"><mixed-citation><named-content con